From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] geolocation: Geopoint, Geocoordinate and Geoposition interfaces, DesiredAccuracyInMeters, default geoposition (3670)

geolocation: Geopoint, Geocoordinate/Geoposition interfaces, DesiredAccuracyInMeters, default geoposition

Geocoordinate also exposes Point (a Geopoint, with IGeoshape), PositionSource,
SatelliteData (null), PositionSourceTimestamp and IsRemoteSource; Geoposition
exposes IGeoposition2 (VenueData, null). The Geopoint class and its factory are
added. Geolocator gets DesiredAccuracyInMeters and the statics get
DefaultGeoposition / IsDefaultGeopositionRecommended: the default position
answers when no location service is present. The IID of IGeocoordinate was
mistyped in Wine's IDL (ac70 instead of 4c70) and is corrected.
---
diff --git a/dlls/geolocation/main.c b/dlls/geolocation/main.c
index ef0cf32..c037036 100644
--- a/dlls/geolocation/main.c
